																			<p className="framer-text framer-styles-preset-ftfde0" dir="auto" style={{ "--framer-text-color": "var(--extracted-r6o4lv, var(--variable-reference-wZ9kK1zmf-bkjB1FjjJ))" }}>
																				Better Budgeting
																			</p>
