																					<p dir="auto" className="framer-text framer-styles-preset-15gu9gr">
																						Sente helps you make sense of the activity behind your finances, so you can understand not just what changed, but what may have caused it. By bringing your financial information together, Sente can help you identify spending patterns, changes in income, recurring expenses, and shifts in your overall financial position.
																					</p>
